    - [ ] Implement Mermaid dependency graph rendering\\n     - [ ] Create resource estimates display\\n     - [ ] Develop execution wave visualization\\n     - [ ] Add Approve/Reject/Modify action buttons\\n\\n2. Backend (FastAPI)\\n   - Implement API Endpoints:\\n     - [ ] POST /api/decompose\\n     - [ ] POST /api/approve-plan\\n     - [ ] GET /api/decomposition-history\\n\\n3. Core Decomposition Engine\\n   - TaskDecompositionEngine (decomposition_engine.py)\\n     - [ ] Implement analyze_task() method\\n     - [ ] Implement decompose_task() method\\n     - [ ] Implement generate_dependency_graph() method\\n     - [ ] Implement estimate_resources() method\\n     - [ ] Implement optimize_allocation() method\\n     - [ ] Implement generate_execution_schedule() method\\n\\n## Success Criteria\\n- Fully functional task decomposition system\\n- Ability to break down complex tasks into parallel executable components\\n- Resource estimation and optimization\\n- Visualizable dependency and execution graphs\\n- Persistent history of task decompositions\\n\\n## Technical Constraints\\n- Frontend: React with Mermaid.js for visualization\\n- Backend: FastAPI with Python\\n- Dependency graph generation using NetworkX\\n- Resource estimation with configurable parameters\\n\\n## Out of Scope\\n- Advanced machine learning model training\\n- Distributed computing integration\\n- Enterprise-level scalability beyond prototype"}'}, {'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01XJ2TYKYafuKZHj75Xkb9JQ', 'content': '{"success": true, "current_branch": "main", "changes": {"staged": [{"file": "oordinators/frontend_coordinator.md", "status": "M"}], "unstaged": [{"file": "docs/AGENT_HIERARCHY.md", "status": "M"}, {"file": "leadership/development_manager.md", "status": "M"}, {"file": "leadership/development_manager.md.pre_improvement", "status": "M"}, {"file": "leadership/executive_director.md", "status": "M"}, {"file": "leadership/executive_director.md.pre_improvement", "status": "M"}, {"file": "leadership/tdd_coordinator.md", "status": "M"}, {"file": "logs/ensemble-backend.log.1", "status": "M"}, {"file": "logs/ensemble-backend.log.2", "status": "M"}, {"file": "logs/ensemble-backend.log.3", "status": "M"}, {"file": "logs/ensemble-backend.log.4", "status": "M"}, {"file": "src/field/ensemble_ui/backend/main.py", "status": "M"}, {"file": "src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/App.jsx", "status": "M"}, {"file": "src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/components/AgentStatsDashboard.jsx", "status": "M"}, {"file": "src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/components/CompletedWorkDashboard.jsx", "status": "M"}, {"file": "src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/components/ProjectsDashboard.jsx", "status": "M"}, {"file": "src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/components/RecoveryDashboard.jsx", "status": "M"}, {"file": "src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/data/funFacts.js", "status": "M"}, {"file": "src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/services/api.js", "status": "M"}, {"file": "src/field/ensemble_ui/output/architecture.md", "status": "M"}, {"file": "src/field/ensemble_ui/output/backend_tasks_m1.md", "status": "M"}, {"file": "src/field/ensemble_ui/output/frontend_tasks_m1.md", "status": "M"}, {"file": "src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md", "status": "M"}, {"file": "src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md", "status": "M"}, {"file": "src/field/ensemble_ui/output/test_tasks.md", "status": "M"}, {"file": "src/field/ensemble_ui/output/test_tasks_m1.md", "status": "M"}, {"file": "src/runtime/agents/achievements.py", "status": "M"}, {"file": "src/runtime/agents/definition.py", "status": "M"}, {"file": "src/runtime/agents/runtime.py", "status": "M"}, {"file": "src/runtime/agents/self_improvement.py", "status": "M"}, {"file": "src/runtime/agents/swarm_recovery.py", "status": "M"}, {"file": "src/runtime/agents/swarm_state.py", "status": "M"}, {"file": "tests/runtime/agents/naming/test_name_generator.py", "status": "M"}, {"file": "tests/runtime/agents/test_famous_mustards_ca