acked up\\\\\\\\n- Immediate reversion possible by restoring original model preference\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n## 8. Expected Outcomes\\\\\\\\n- \\\\\\\\ud83c\\\\\\\\udfaf Cost optimization achieved\\\\\\\\n- \\\\\\\\ud83d\\\\\\\\udd12 Agent functionality preserved\\\\\\\\n- \\\\\\\\ud83d\\\\\\\\udca1 Minimal, precise configuration update\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n## 9. Open Questions for Review\\\\\\\\n- Confirm \\\\\'sonnet\\\\\' model availability\\\\\\\\n- Validate cost-saving projections\\\\\\\\n- Verify no hidden dependencies on \\\\\'haiku\\\\\'\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n## 10. Implementation Complexity\\\\\\\\n**Complexity Score**: Low (1/10)\\\\\\\\n- Single-line change\\\\\\\\n- No structural modifications\\\\\\\\n- Minimal risk profile\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n**Estimated Effort**: 15-30 minutes\\"}\'}]}, {\'role\': \'assistant\', \'content\': [{\'type\': \'tool_use\', \'id\': \'toolu_01DEK1nFyvCSQcUtzdKGUaJp\', \'name\': \'project_tracking\', \'input\': {\'action\': \'create_project\', \'project_name\': \'Frontend Coordinator Model Preference Update\', \'description\': \\"Update model preference from \'haiku\' to \'sonnet\' in Frontend Coordinator definition\\"}}]}, {\'role\': \'user\', \'content\': [{\'type\': \'tool_result\', \'tool_use_id\': \'toolu_01DEK1nFyvCSQcUtzdKGUaJp\', \'content\': \'{\\"success\\": true, \\"project_id\\": \\"f4a8d418\\", \\"message\\": \\"Created project: Frontend Coordinator Model Preference Update\\", \\"summary\\": {\\"project_id\\": \\"f4a8d418\\", \\"project_name\\": \\"Frontend Coordinator Model Preference Update\\", \\"description\\": \\"Update model preference from \\\\\'haiku\\\\\' to \\\\\'sonnet\\\\\' in Frontend Coordinator definition\\", \\"status\\": \\"active\\", \\"created_at\\": \\"2026-01-17T12:58:13.878132\\", \\"updated_at\\": \\"2026-01-17T12:58:13.878132\\", \\"task_counts\\": {\\"total\\": 0, \\"todo\\": 0, \\"in_progress\\": 0, \\"completed\\": 0, \\"blocked\\": 0, \\"cancelled\\": 0}, \\"completion_percentage\\": 0.0, \\"recent_notes