es are expected from the model switch\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n## Technical Details\\\\\\\\n- **Target File**: `/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/coordinators/frontend_coordinator.md`\\\\\\\\n- **Section to Update**: `## Model Preference`\\\\\\\\n- **Current Value**: `haiku`\\\\\\\\n- **New Value**: `sonnet`\\\\\\\\n- **Configuration Format**: Simple text value under the Model Preference heading\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n## Rationale\\\\\\\\nThe Frontend Coordinator has demonstrated exceptional performance with a 98.41% success rate, indicating that it can maintain effectiveness with a more cost-efficient model. The \\\\\'sonnet\\\\\' model provides a balance of capability and cost that aligns with optimization goals while preserving the agent\\\\\'s proven effectiveness.\\"}\'}]}, {\'role\': \'assistant\', \'content\': [{\'type\': \'tool_use\', \'id\': \'toolu_01M55X1CaWF21B9mXwpqrB2t\', \'name\': \'spawn_agent\', \'input\': {\'agent_type\': \'coordinators/frontend_coordinator\', \'input_data\': {\'problem_description\': \\"Update model preference from \'haiku\' to \'sonnet\' in Frontend Coordinator definition\\", \'requirements_file\': \'/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md\', \'output_directory\': \'/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/coordinators\', \'specific_task\': \'modify_model_preference\'}}}]}, {\'role\': \'user\', \'content\': [{\'type\': \'tool_result\', \'tool_use_id\': \'toolu_01M55X1CaWF21B9mXwpqrB2t\', \'content\': \'{\\"success\\": false, \\"error\\": \\"Missing required input field: milestone\\"}\'}]}, {\'role\': \'assistant\', \'content\': [{\'type\': \'tool_use\', \'id\': \'toolu_01LS8CSugNJMRkznxtVdswB2\', \'name\': \'spawn_agent\', \'input\': {\'agent_type\': \'coordinators/frontend_coordinator\', \'input_data\': {\'problem_description\': \\"Update model preference from \'haiku\' to \'sonnet\' in Frontend Coordinator definition\\", \'requirements_file\': \'/U